<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - S3 cut to attractive.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - S3 cut to attractive.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber said it cut its rating for S3 Inc to attractive from buy.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were off 1-6/16 at 9-5/16.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
